  - **Content:** Hard errors, near-misses, high-variance Q/A, and edge cases; 2% capacity, class/domain-balanced.
  - **Sampling:** 80% balanced + 20% hard-example bias.
- **Training loop:**
  - **Batch composition:** 50% new, 50% replay.
  - **Loss:** CE on adapters + KD (LwF) using backbone+previous best adapter as teacher; no raw data? enable synthetic Q/A via RAG for generative replay.
- **Merged-distillation:**
  - Every 8 adapter updates, distill to a single “consolidated” adapter per macro-domain to keep latency/memory in check.
- **Privacy path:**
